{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/139073-the-pledge-of-the-phoenix","id":139073,"title":"The Pledge of the Phoenix","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-05-16T00:23:47-07:00","id":139073,"title":"The Pledge of the Phoenix","content":"When I was reading about the Dread Lands of the Chapter on Faerie in Equinox Road, I saw a blurb of how the Gentry of the Dread Lands made a pledge with the Phoenix to give the Changelings in their service a sort of Highlander-ish immortality. Does that pledge stay with the Changeling when he or she escapes, and if not, is there a plot kit to make a pledge with the Phoenix, due to the dangers of the World of Darkness, and the fact that some races, like the Sin-Eaters, don't stay dead?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/891-jackalopevegas","name":"JackalopeVegas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-16T00:59:23-07:00","id":139100,"title":"","content":"Depends on what the pledge is. It's a pledge. Unless you can trick them escaping would almost definitely break the pledge.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/116-epimetheus","name":"Epimetheus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1758"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-17T03:04:18-07:00","id":140376,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epimetheus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/139073-the-pledge-of-the-phoenix?p=139100#post139100\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Depends on what the pledge is. It's a pledge. Unless you can trick them escaping would almost definitely break the pledge.</div> </div> </div> </div>So then it'll HAVE to be a plot-kit then. *Sigh*","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/891-jackalopevegas","name":"JackalopeVegas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-17T03:20:29-07:00","id":140387,"title":"","content":"To my knowledge, there are three existing ways in Changeling to return someone from the dead. You can do a favour for the Pale Man (a Morphean in Dancers in the Dusk), you can enter the Death Pact (it's called something along the lines, an ability Changelings gain upon entering the Underworld, where they can sacrifice a permanent dot of Willpower to gain a respawn upon death), and the phoenix creature in Grim Fears, which returns a dying being to life at the cost of a young child's life.<br /> <br /> You could probably use one of these as a model if you wanted to write up a power similar to the pledge mentioned in Equinox Road.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1059-azahul","name":"Azahul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-18T12:07:28-07:00","id":141729,"title":"","content":"Actually when I read the blurb, I thought the pledge was part of an entire Contract. So FML I guess.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/891-jackalopevegas","name":"JackalopeVegas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-18T22:53:42-07:00","id":142107,"title":"","content":"Since it's part of the &quot;Laws of the Land&quot; section for that Domain, I'd say it only applies while in that Domain, and not something the Changeling takes with them (since they're not actually part of the pledge/deal, the True Fae of that specific realm was).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/137x125q90/745/a5GS5M.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/802-amaterasu","name":"amaterasu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"208"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}